{"id":"eb66acfb892e62da","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-forces-pfa.md","title":"ZFC Forces PFA","display":"df-zfc-forces-pfa — ZFC Forces PFA","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forces-pfa","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forces-pfa"],"display":"df-zfc-forces-pfa — ZFC Forces PFA","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forces-pfa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forces-pfa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forces-pfa — ZFC Forces PFA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md\">../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span> (forcing-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PFA}\\)</span> (Proper Forcing Axiom sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md\">../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcesPFA}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcesPFA}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}pfa} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcesPFA}_S(\\mathbb P,M)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P},\\ulcorner\\mathrm{PFA}\\urcorner,\\langle\\rangle,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}pfa} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcesPFA}_S(\\mathbb P,M)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P},\\ulcorner\\mathrm{PFA}\\urcorner,\\langle\\rangle,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The top condition, PFA sentence, poset predicate, and forcing relation now all have explicit sources; the former infix forcing notation had none.</li>\n<li>The ground model and all six forcing-relation arguments are explicit, while the unary poset datum is unpacked inside the predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4fc856eb9fe0887","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S$ (forcing-relation predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4fc856eb9fe0887","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PFA}$ (Proper Forcing Axiom sentence, see [[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcesPFA}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forces\\text{-}pfa} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcesPFA}_S(\\mathbb P,M)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,\\mathbf1_{\\mathbb P},\\ulcorner\\mathrm{PFA}\\urcorner,\\langle\\rangle,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1561,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1942","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-forces-pfa.md|58-df-zfc-forces-pfa]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","911508dbd8495663","f4fc856eb9fe0887"]}